      "heading": "Introducere",
      "level": 1,
      "content_markdown": "Something new, something blue, green, orange & black\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/t20100-2_4.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/t20100-2_3.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/t20100-2_1.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/t20100-4_1.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/t20100-3_1.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/t20100-1_1.jpg)\n\n**INSTRUCTIONS – HOSE HOLDERS** – Miflex hose holders are dedicated to 11.1/7 -liter aluminum cylinders and other cylinders with a diameter of 182/152 mm. The handles should be installed on the cylinder by putting on rubber bands, as symmetrically as possible, at a distance from each other that guarantees holding the entire length of the hose and its movement under the handle.\n**WARNING** – before diving, check and practice the configuration according to all safety rules applicable in the diving standards of the user of diving equipment."
    },
